    <item>
      <title>[Linux] 安装uv</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85uv/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85uv/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[Linux] 安装uv</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="安装uv">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85uv"></a>
安装uv
</h1><h4 id="1-进入tmp下载uv">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e8%bf%9b%e5%85%a5tmp%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bduv"></a>
1. 进入tmp下载uv
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cd</span> <span class="o">/</span><span class="n">tmp</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">wget</span> <span class="n">https</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="o">//</span><span class="n">github</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">com</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">astral</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">sh</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">uv</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">releases</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">download</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="mf">0.12</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="mi">9</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">uv</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">x86_64</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">unknown</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">linux</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">gnu</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">tar</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">gz</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="2-解压">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e8%a7%a3%e5%8e%8b"></a>
2. 解压
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">tar -zxvf uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">cd uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="3-移动到-usrlocalbin-下">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e7%a7%bb%e5%8a%a8%e5%88%b0-usrlocalbin-%e4%b8%8b"></a>
3. 移动到 <code>/usr/local/bin</code> 下
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uv /usr/local/bin
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo cp uvx /usr/local/bin
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="4-检查安装">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#4-%e6%a3%80%e6%9f%a5%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85"></a>
4. 检查安装
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">uv --version
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uvx --version
</span></span></code></pre></div>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-09-07首发于<a href='https://byzhrichard.github.io/'>byzh的博客</a>，最后修改于2026-09-07</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>Linux</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

    <item>
      <title>[Linux] 设置快捷命令</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link>
